### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### Create a new trip (Valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/trips
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Summer in Paris",
  "description": "A wonderful 2-week vacation in France.",
  "start_date": "2026-06-01",
  "end_date": "2026-06-15",
  "is_public": true
}

### Create a new trip (Invalid - missing name, bad dates)
POST {{baseUrl}}/trips
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "start_date": "2026-06-15",
  "end_date": "2026-06-01"
}

### Get all my trips
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get public trips
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips?public=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a single trip by ID (Replace 1 with actual ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a trip
PUT {{baseUrl}}/trips/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Summer in Paris and Lyon",
  "end_date": "2026-06-20"
}

### Delete a trip
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/trips/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
